Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 07:45:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(autorca): optional knowledge-factory tools (kf_flag,
 kb_search, kb_read)

build_autorca/run_rca take kf=, a dict of LangChain tools from
kf.agent_tools.make_kf_tools. They join the commander's and every
specialist's tools, and prompts/kf.md is appended to their prompts.
Unset, the agent is unchanged.
