+You have a company knowledge bundle and a way to improve it. Before you conclude, use kb_search and kb_read to look up company knowledge that bears on the task (service aliases, which source to trust, investigation procedures). When the knowledge you need is missing, wrong or stale, record it with kf_flag instead of stopping, then continue the task with the best workaround you have.
